   "desc": "On this month’s edition of Pleiades w/ Astro Tash, we celebrate the start of the silly season with the Sun’s change into Sagittarius! When it comes to the Sagittarius spirit, there’s no glass ceiling on adventure and possibility. Ride the (sound)waves of introspective euphoria through to dancing in communion with experimental dance pop, minimal wave and organic house textures from near and far, enveloped by an ethereal, stargazey start & finish. This one’s dedicated to my fellow free-spirited, fun + freaky centaurs out there <3",
